{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"promoted":1,"teasers":41},[2,15,27],{"title":3,"employer":4,"tags":5,"image":9,"alt":3,"released":10,"promoted":11,"slug":12,"content":13,"canonical":14},"Lego Boost","noprotocol",[6,7,8],"vue","rxjs","multitouch","lego-boost.png","",1,"top1","\u003Cp>Verreweg het leukste project ooit. Een campagne site waarbij je zelf blokken in een timeline kon slepen om zodoende de LEGO Boost robot te programmeren.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Een leuke uitdaging met o.a. multi-touch drag-and-drop en video&#39;s die soepel en met geluid in willekeurige volgorde worden afgespeeld.\u003C/p>\n","lego-boost",{"title":16,"employer":17,"tags":18,"image":22,"released":10,"promoted":23,"slug":24,"content":25,"canonical":26},"Smart Clock","open source",[19,20,21],"golang","sdl2","raspberry-pi","smart-clock.png",2,"top2","\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/bfanger/clock\">Smart Clock\u003C/a> is een app die ik voor ons gezin heb gemaakt. Deze draait in de woonkamer op een Raspberry Pi met een \u003Ca href=\"https://shop.pimoroni.com/products/hyperpixel-4\">4.0 inch scherm\u003C/a> naast de TV.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Naast dat deze de tijd weergeeft met analoge wijzers, zodat mijn zoontje (en ik) beter leerde klokkijken is de klok door de jaren heen verder uitgebreid met nuttige informatie zoals:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Timer die aftelt voordat school begint, met tijden uit \u003Ca href=\"https://magister.nl/\">Magister\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Welke afvalbak er aan de straat gezet moet worden obv de \u003Ca href=\"https://www.hvcgroep.nl/afval/afvalkalender\">HVC afvalkalender\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Het volume van mijn Sonos Ray soundbar\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Is er het aankomende uur regen voorspeld vanuit \u003Ca href=\"https://www.buienradar.nl/\">Buienradar\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>en meer...\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n","smart-clock",{"title":28,"employer":29,"released":10,"image":30,"alt":28,"tags":31,"promoted":37,"slug":38,"content":39,"canonical":40},"NLZIET","triple","nlziet.png",[32,33,7,34,35,36],"svelte","typescript","smarttv","bitmovin","shaka-player",3,"top3","\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.nlziet.nl/\">NLZIET\u003C/a> is een alternatief voor kabeltelevisie, maar naast live tv kijken biedt deze dienst ook extra features zoals terugkijken of reclamevrij kijken.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Wij hebben voor NLZIET de SmartTV app ontwikkeld, deze maakt gebruik van het Mauna Framework dat we bij Triple ontwikkeld hebben.\u003C/p>\n","nlziet",[42,48,54,60,66,72,78,83,89,95,101,107,113,119,125,131,137,143,149,155,161,167,173,179,183,189,195,200,205,211,217,223,229,235,241,247,253,259,265,269,273,278,283,287,293,298,304,308,314,320,325,330,336,342,348,352,358,364,370,376,379,385,391,397,402,408,413,417,423,429,433,439,445,451,457,463,467,473,479,485,491,495,501,507,513,519,525,531,537,543,549,555,561,567,571,577,583,589,595,600,605,611,617,623,629,635,640,645,650,655,660,665,670,675,680,685,690,696,701,706,711,716,722,727,732,737,742,748,754,760,765,770,776,781,785,790,795,801,807,813,819],{"slug":43,"title":44,"released":45,"thumbnail":46,"aspect":47},"slopcorp","SlopCorp","2026-10-05","/build/thumbnails/slopcorp.jpg","1820/1556",{"slug":49,"title":50,"released":51,"thumbnail":52,"aspect":53},"agent-container","Agent Container","2026-06","/build/thumbnails/agent-container.jpg","386/359",{"slug":55,"title":56,"released":57,"thumbnail":58,"aspect":59},"poppenkast-3d","Virtuele Poppenkast","2026-03-01","/build/thumbnails/poppenkast.jpg","1520/797",{"slug":61,"title":62,"released":63,"thumbnail":64,"aspect":65},"dice-game-update","Dice Game 2.0","2026-02-05","/build/thumbnails/dice-game-update.jpg","2046/1348",{"slug":67,"title":68,"released":69,"thumbnail":70,"aspect":71},"this-nl","Nieuwe huisstijl voor this.nl","2026-01","/build/thumbnails/this.nl.jpg","2642/1890",{"slug":73,"title":74,"released":75,"thumbnail":76,"aspect":77},"this-portfolio","Portfolio website van This is Creative","2025-11"